Package: comfy-downloader
Version: __VERSION__
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Winery (WangZhenYu) <https://github.com/zhwangsir/AIGCPannel>
Homepage: https://github.com/zhwangsir/AIGCPannel
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libgtk-3-0
Description: AIGCPannel 模型库桌面助手
 Native GUI tool that downloads ComfyUI models from Civitai and HuggingFace
 into the correct model subfolders, with resume, SHA256 verification and a
 download queue. Single self-contained executable, no command line needed.
